D-195,Table 7 caption: the extended contrast is higher than the raw probe on every test set at every layer.,(36 cells of Table 7),draft p.17 Table 7 caption; draft_claims_raw.csv D-195,"git show origin/feat/persona-pc-ood:src/probes/deception-detection/results/persona_ood_ext_L{20,40,44}/matrix_ext_axis1.csv, matrix_baseline.csv","18 column means (6 test sets x 3 layers), each over the 5 non-self training rows",18/18 cells higher. All 36 printed Table-7 values reproduce to 3 dp.,YES,Table 7 recomputed in full from his matrices; 0 mismatches.,P5_draft_headlines.py section C.,"origin/feat/persona-pc-ood @ tip, read with `git show` (never checked out); his activations are gone -> Level 2 on his pipeline impossible (owner's rule). Files are his own committed CSVs; not touched by the 09-22 re-run wave (RF-13), which hit the OWNER's lab stores only.",Identical evidence to D-027/D-009; only three layers exist.,MATCHES HIS DATA (Level 1; Table 7 re-derived),HIGH,MED - it is a caption restating D-027,audit/scripts/claims/P5_draft_headlines.py,,P5-draft-headlines
