D-101,"At layer 20 with HP-KR removed, the published 8v7 contrast is marginally ahead of the extended 12v13 one (0.919 vs 0.909 mean off-diagonal AUROC), so at that layer the whole gain is the HP-KR repair.",0.919; 0.909,draft main (1).pdf p.8 sec 5.2 + p.12 sec 6 + Table 3,persona_ood_ext_L20/summary.csv,off_diagonal_excl_hpkr for features axis1 and ext_axis1,axis1 0.919401; ext_axis1 0.908627,YES (tol 5e-4),Level 2 on his pipeline NOT POSSIBLE (his activations are gone; owner's rule). Recomputed where his own cell-level CSVs allow it.,n/a,"his branch @ tip; his own committed CSVs; NOT touched by the 2026-09-22 re-run wave (RF-13 hit the OWNER's lab stores). Persona bank = the owner's kd bank, byte-identical to lab run-kd/vectors_s3 (RF-1 RESOLVED). Activations gone -> Level 2 on his pipeline impossible.",At L40 and L44 the ordering reverses (D-102). The gap at L20 is 0.0108 with no interval reported in the draft; the store has no bootstrap for the excl-HP-KR aggregate.,MATCHES HIS DATA (Level 1 only),HIGH - exact match,"HIGH - this is the draft's own strongest caveat, restated in section 6 (D-156)",audit/scripts/claims/P8_draft_rest.py,D-156 (section 6 Limitations) restates the same fact and is covered by this row.,P8-draft-rest
