D-157,"In the layer-40 transfer matrix, balanced accuracy at the Alpaca threshold sits at its 0.5 floor in 18 of the 30 off-diagonal cells for the raw probes.",18/30,draft main (1).pdf p.12 sec 6 Calibration,persona_ood_ext_L40/summary_balacc.csv; matrix_balacc_baseline.csv; his persona_ood.py:481,features=baseline: cells_at_floor / off_diagonal_cells,18 of 30,YES - his file says 18,"RECOMPUTED: only 14 of the 30 cells are EXACTLY 0.5. His counter is cells_at_floor(matrix, floor=0.5, tol=0.005), and the +-0.005 band adds exactly four cells: HP-C->HP-KR 0.4992, HP-KR->ID 0.5011, HP-C->CG 0.503, IT->ID 0.5048.",tolerance sweep over the 30 off-diagonal cells of his own matrix CSV; definition read from his script,"his branch @ tip; his own committed CSVs; NOT touched by the 2026-09-22 re-run wave (RF-13 hit the OWNER's lab stores). Persona bank = the owner's kd bank, byte-identical to lab run-kd/vectors_s3 (RF-1 RESOLVED). Activations gone -> Level 2 on his pipeline impossible.","Sweep: tol 0 -> 14, 0.001 -> 15, 0.002 -> 16, 0.005 -> 18, 0.01 -> 18.","MATCHES HIS DATA (Level 1 only); but 'sits AT its 0.5 floor' overstates by 4 cells (14 exactly, 18 within +-0.005)",HIGH - the tolerance is hard-coded in his own script and I reproduced the count,"MED - it is a limitation paragraph, and the honest version is barely weaker",audit/scripts/claims/P8_appG_and_floor.py,Proposed wording for DOC_FIXES: 'within 0.005 of its 0.5 floor in 18 of the 30 cells (exactly 0.5 in 14)'.,P8-draft-rest
