F-41,The 8B coords arm OOMed on harm-pressure-knowledge-report at 902.00 MiB; the F-33 exc_tail patch made the line legible; instructed-deception and harm-pressure-choice had completed at attn_budget 2.0; budgets were lowered to 8B 0.75/sess4 and 3B 0.5/sess4 and the resume redid only 32 rows of 119 surviving chunks.,"902.00 MiB; 15072 padded tokens; attn 0.75 / sess 4 (8B), 0.5 / sess 4 (3B); 119 chunks; 32 rows; 5,432 and 2,134 rows",kd/docs/FINDINGS.md:1112,"lab logs/scale_coords_8b.log (L3031, L3058, L4841, L4880-4882, L4894-4924); logs/scale_coords.status; scale/scripts/run_scale_coords.ps1 (header, lines 73-122)",OOM lines by dataset and time; resume lines; recorded attn/sess per start,"L4841 17:31:26 'session attempt 4/4 (2 batches, 15072 padded tokens) failed: ... Tried to allocate 902.00 MiB' - exact; status '17:32:26 8b: coords start ... attn=0.75 sess=4' - exact; resume 'harm-pressure-choice: 32 to do (2102 already on disk)' - exact",partial,"harm-pressure-choice OOMed 4x at attn 2.0 (17:11:58-17:12:27, 748 MiB) and failed permanently (L3058), so it did NOT complete at 2.0; at 0.75 it OOMed again within 60 s (17:32:41-17:33:33) and HP-KR from 17:35:23; budgets were revised to 0.55/4 (17:48), 0.55/1 (18:02) and finally max_length 1024 (18:34); the 3B ran at attn=0.42 sess=1, never 0.5/4","full OOM/resume scan of the 24,276-line log plus the script's own revision header","lab-only (logs/ not on Drive, not in git); log appended 2026-09-22 16:20 by the RF-13 wave with a no-op SKIP",OOM lines by hour: HPC 12 (17:00) + 4 (18:00); HP-KR 162 + 10; last OOM 18:03:50. Script header records '57 OOMs and 14 permanently-failed' at 0.75 and 'the attn budget was never the binding constraint',PARTLY HOLDS,HIGH - every statement is a log line read during this audit,LOW,audit/scripts/claims/W5C_labA.py; audit/scripts/claims/W5C_labC.py,'119 chunks survived' appears in no log line and the store was later deleted and re-extracted (F-47) -> NO RAW DATA for that sub-number. Th