O-100,"On the marker-free v4+v5 subset (ironic marker rate 0.00) the ironic and sycophantic arms are still separated at 0.919 raw / 0.921 stripped, n = 80 - the decisive gate measurement.",0.00; 0.919; 0.921; 80,docs/thesis/sarcasm-pilot-negative-result.md:118 (and :121-122),"audit/cache/labpc/cap/run-sarc-pilot/responses/{pc_ironic_critic,pc_sycophant}.jsonl","grouped bag-of-words AUROC restricted to prompt_index in {3,4}; marker rates per variant",this row exists in NO file (marker_report.json stores only the all-variant pair); marker rate 0.00 at v4 and v5 confirmed from the stored per_variant array,n/a - no stored counterpart,"Implementation A: 0.9194 raw / 0.9213 stripped. Implementation B (own sklearn pipeline): 0.9194 / 0.9213. n = 80. Marker effect = -0.0019, i.e. the document's '-0.002'.","audit/scripts/claims/W6D_sarcasm.py, two independent implementations over the raw rollouts","md5-verified cached lab rollouts (09-21 21:26-21:40, unchanged by the RF-13 wave)","Independently corroborated twice: the current lab chain status (2026-09-22 15:55) reports 'bag-of-words AUROC on unmarked(v4,v5), markers stripped=0.921 ... GATE FAILED', and cap/docs/SARCASM_DESIGN.md's PILOT RESULT table records 0.921 on v4+v5 grouped by item.",HOLDS,HIGH,HIGH,audit/scripts/claims/W6D_sarcasm.py -> audit/phase2/out/W6D/W6D_sarcasm.txt,"The number that killed the sarcasm bank. It exceeds the 0.65 bar by 0.27 and v1's pre-registered ~0.75 bar by 0.17, so the gate failure is robust to O-097's finding that 0.65 was chosen after the data. Small sample (40 per arm over 20 questions) is the document's own limitation 2.",W6D-ownerdocs
