D-228,HP-KR: L20/L40/L44 = 0.043 0.167 0.480,0.043 0.167 0.480,draft p19 Table 11 (sycophancy contrast 5v5),"origin/paper:src/probes/deception-detection/results/persona_ood_ext_L{20,40,44}/zero_shot.csv","dataset=HP-KR, column auroc_syc_axis",see level2_value,yes,HP-KR: L20/L40/L44 = 0.043 0.167 0.480 -- EXACT,"re-derived from the collaborator's raw result files on origin/paper (git show, no checkout) and from the Liars' Bench PDF",origin/paper @ ea1ce52b,"single seed, his pipeline; three layers L20/L40/L44",MATCHES HIS DATA,high,medium,audit/scripts/p16_level2.py,"Reproduces exactly from the zero-shot sycophancy-axis column. Note L44 = 0.4804 -- below 0.5, so 'inverts at every layer' holds, but at L44 it is marginal (0.020 below chance) against 0.457 below at L20. Say 'inverts, weakening with depth'. [Phase 6 / 6A Level 2, 2026-09-24]",B40
