D-025,We also identify why the published contrast inverts there: none of its deceptive personas lies by denying knowledge.,,draft p2 1 Contributions,kd/personas/kd_role_groups.json,groups.deception.roles and .note,none of the 8 published deceptive personas lies by denying knowledge -- CONFIRMED,yes,,Level 1 -- number located in a result file,origin/paper @ ea1ce52b,"single seed, his pipeline; three layers L20/L40/L44",MATCHES HIS DATA,high,medium,audit/scripts/p16_level1.py,"The eight are handler, broker, impression_manager, coverup_operator, gatekeeper, spin_doctor, plausible_denier, narrative_manager -- all specialists in omission, timing and spin. The bank file's own note for the group is 'control disclosure: timing, emphasis, omission'. [Phase 6 / 6A Level 1, 2026-09-24]",B02
